# Montants en centimes entiers, bornés à ±(2^53 - 1) (transactions, récurrentes, comptes, épargne, périodes, filtres).
# Lancement : npx httpyac send --all http/montants-centimes-entiers.http --var port=8080 --var anon=<ANON_KEY de `supabase status`>
# (la clé vient de la ligne de commande, jamais du fichier ; l'utilisateur est jetable, créé par le fichier)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:{{port}}
@authUrl = http://127.0.0.1:54321/auth/v1

### Utilisateur jetable
# @name login
POST {{authUrl}}/signup
apikey: {{anon}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "montants-{{$timestamp}}@example.com", "password": "Password123!" }

?? status == 200

### Compte jetable pour le test
# @name account
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "montants-{{$timestamp}}", "initialBalance": "0" }

?? status == 201

### Transaction : "12.5" refusé (plus d'arrondi silencieux à 13)
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-10-01", "description": "decimal", "amount": "12.5" }

?? status == 400

### Transaction : montant au-delà de 2^53 - 1 refusé (400 et non 500)
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-10-01", "description": "trop grand", "amount": "99999999999999999999999" }

?? status == 400

### Transaction : dépense "-1234" créée telle quelle
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-10-01", "description": "depense", "amount": "-1234" }

?? status == 201
?? body contains "amount":"-1234"

### Modification d'une transaction : "12.5" refusé
# @name tx
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-10-01", "description": "a-modifier", "amount": "500" }

?? status == 201

###
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/transactions/{{tx.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": "12.5" }

?? status == 400

### Après le refus, la transaction est intacte (relecture par la liste)
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/transactions?search=a-modifier
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}

?? status == 200
?? body contains "amount":"500"

### Récurrente : "12.5" refusé
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/recurring
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "description": "loyer", "amount": "12.5", "dayOfMonth": 5 }

?? status == 400

### Récurrente : cas nominal
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/recurring
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "description": "loyer", "amount": "-65000", "dayOfMonth": 5 }

?? status == 201
?? body contains "amount":"-65000"

### Transaction : le plus grand montant accepté (2^53 - 1) est créé tel quel
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-10-02", "description": "borne-max", "amount": "9007199254740991" }

?? status == 201
?? body contains "amount":"9007199254740991"

### ... et relu exactement par la liste
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/transactions?search=borne-max
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}

?? status == 200
?? body contains "amount":"9007199254740991"

### Transaction : 2^53 refusé
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-10-02", "description": "borne-depassee", "amount": "9007199254740992" }

?? status == 400

### Compte : solde initial "12.5" refusé
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "decimal-{{$timestamp}}", "initialBalance": "12.5" }

?? status == 400

### Compte : cas nominal avec solde initial
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "nominal-{{$timestamp}}", "initialBalance": "150000" }

?? status == 201
?? body contains "initialBalance":"150000"

### Épargne : targetAmount "12.5" refusé
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/savings-goals
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "vacances", "targetAmount": "12.5" }

?? status == 400

### Période : amountAllocated "abc" refusé (400 et non 500)
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/periods
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "startDate": "2026-11-01", "endDate": "2026-11-30", "budgets": [{ "categoryId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000019", "amountAllocated": "abc" }] }

?? status == 400

### Filtre : minAmount=1.5 refusé (400 et non 500)
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/transactions?minAmount=1.5
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}

?? status == 400
